    "items": [
     {
      "pClass": "productdescription",
      "pText": "Candilicious Play is a candy-themed play station with yellow candy panels, a red bead panel, a climbing net and tube slides in red and blue. Rope bridge crossings and stacked net planes give children several ways up, so each child can pick a route that suits their confidence. It is meant for ages 5 to 12 and takes up to 15 children at a time. The station is long and slim at 27'11\" x 11'5\", with a safe play area of 33'11\" x 16'5\", so it works along the edge of a society garden. Climbing and sliding here build balance, coordination and spatial awareness. Finished in multiple colours, it carries our 3-year warranty on the main structure. Ask us for a layout drawing."
     }
